Returns all active deposit products and valid account types for populating the Open Account form. Roles: ADMIN, TELLER. Use the returned product IDs in `POST /api/v1/accounts`.

Example response:
```json
{
  "data": {
    "depositProducts": [
      { "id": "...", "name": "Classic Savings", "interestRate": 3.5, "minimumBalance": 100.0, "currencyCode": "USD" }
    ],
    "accountTypes": ["SAVINGS", "CHECKING", "FIXED_DEPOSIT"]
  }
}
```

